  "2026-11-11T14:11:18.011Z",codex-changelog339-1111,"Final scoped round on accepted head 67ed925: fetched all three new review threads and their complete comments/diff hunks (PRRT_kwDOSfkApc62Mhts, PRRT_kwDOSfkApc62Mhtv, PRRT_kwDOSfkApc62Mht1). Preserve accepted nine-thread fixes. Add prepend-cleanup operator action and invariant coverage, document file-output versus stdout checks, and retain pre-2026.11.7 ordering behind the shared rendering profile table with upgrade-version evidence. Validate real trackers and isolated behavioral reverts, then bounded gates and same-branch push; do not close own item."
